---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/resume';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Srikar Madarapu — AI Engineer in Sunnyvale, California. Photographer and road-trip enthusiast off the clock."
	pubDate={new Date('November 16 2026')}
	heroImage="/srikar2.jpg"
>
	<p>
		Hello! I’m Srikar Madarapu, an AI Engineer based in {profile.location}. I build production-grade agentic systems —
		currently as a {profile.currentRole} at {profile.currentOrg}, where I automate SDLC workflows for network engineering
		teams. Before that I led an AI procurement platform from 0→1 at Right Pro, did computer vision research at DePaul’s
		MedIX Lab, and founded a visual data startup in Bangalore.
	</p>

	<p>
		Off the clock, photography has been a big part of my life for over a decade, and I love exploring new places by
		road.
	</p>

	<p>Here are some of my road trip adventures:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Seattle to Miami</strong> (In Planning)</li>
		<li><strong>Chicago to Seattle to San Francisco to Dallas to Miami to Boston to Chicago</strong> (In Planning)</li>
		<li><strong>Chicago to DC to New York</strong> (Completed)</li>
		<li><strong>New York to Boston</strong> (Completed)</li>
		<li><strong>New York to Atlanta</strong> (Completed)</li>
		<li><strong>Atlanta to Tampa</strong> (Completed)</li>
		<li><strong>Atlanta to Dallas to NOLA</strong> (Completed)</li>
		<li><strong>LA to San Francisco</strong> (Completed)</li>
		<li><strong>San Francisco to Seattle</strong> (Completed)</li>
		<li><strong>Chicago to Madison</strong> (Completed)</li>
		<li><strong>Chicago to Cincinnati</strong> (Completed)</li>
		<li><strong>Chicago to Omaha</strong> (Completed)</li>
	</ul>
	<p>Beyond traveling, I enjoy playing board and card games.</p>

	<p>
		Want to build something together? Reach me at <a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email}</a> or on
		<a href={profile.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a>.
	</p>

